  (vector "kotoba-lang/bmc repo scope (portable .cljc BMC canvas/ledger/gate/io core, zero product literals)"
   "kotoba-lang/bmc as a standalone west-managed project, not files tracked directly in com-junkawasaki/root's own git history"
